#: AnnotationDialog/Dialog.cpp:1188
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>You have just opened the advanced search dialog; to get the most out of "
"it, it is suggested that you read the section in the manual on <a href="
"\"help:/kphotoalbum/sect-general-image-searches.html\">advanced searching</"
"a>.</p><p>This dialog is also used for typing in information about images; "
"you can find extra tips on its usage by reading about <a href=\"help:/"
"kphotoalbum/chp-typingIn.html\">typing in</a>.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Upravo ste otvorili dijaloški okvir naprednog pretraživanja. Kako biste ga najbolje iskoristili, preporučujemo da pročitate odjeljak priručnika o <a href=\"help:/kphotoalbum/sect-general-image-searches.html\">naprednom pretraživanju</a>.</p><p>Ovaj se dijaloški okvir koristi i za unos podataka o slikama; dodatne savjete potražite u odjeljku o <a href=\"help:/kphotoalbum/chp-typingIn.html\">unosu</a>.</p>"

#: AnnotationDialog/Dialog.cpp:1196
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>You have just opened one of the most important windows in KPhotoAlbum; it "
"contains lots of functionality which has been optimized for fast usage.</"
"p><p>It is strongly recommended that you take 5 minutes to read the <a href="
"\"help:/kphotoalbum/chp-typingIn.html\">documentation for this dialog</a></p>"
msgstr "<p>Upravo ste otvorili jedan od najvažnijih prozora programa KPhotoAlbum; sadrži brojne funkcije optimizirane za brzu uporabu.</p><p>Preporučujemo da odvojite pet minuta i pročitate <a href=\"help:/kphotoalbum/chp-typingIn.html\">dokumentaciju za ovaj dijaloški okvir</a>.</p>"

