#: DB/XML/FileReader.cpp:446
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Your images/videos are not sorted, which means that navigating using the "
"date bar will only work suboptimally.</p><p>In the <b>Maintenance</b> menu, "
"you can find <b>Display Images with Incomplete Dates</b> which you can use "
"to find the images that are missing date information.</p><p>You can then "
"select the images that you have reason to believe have a correct date in "
"either their Exif data or on the file, and execute <b>Maintenance->Read Exif "
"Info</b> to reread the information.</p><p>Finally, once all images have "
"their dates set, you can execute <b>Maintenance->Sort All by Date & Time</b> "
"to sort them in the database. </p>"
msgstr "<p>Slike/videozapisi nisu poredani, pa navigacija pomoću trake datuma neće raditi optimalno.</p><p>U izborniku <b>Održavanje</b> pronađite <b>Prikaži slike s nepotpunim datumima</b> kako biste otkrili slike kojima nedostaju podaci o datumu.</p><p>Zatim možete odabrati slike za koje smatrate da imaju točan datum u Exif podacima ili datoteci te pokrenuti <b>Održavanje → Pročitaj Exif podatke</b> da biste ponovno učitali podatke.</p><p>Naposljetku, nakon što svim slikama postavite datume, pokrenite <b>Održavanje → Poredaj sve po datumu i vremenu</b> da biste ih poredali u bazi podataka.</p>"

#: DB/XML/FileReader.cpp:455
#, kde-format
msgid "Images/Videos Are Not Sorted"
msgstr "Slike/videozapisi nisu poredani"

#: DB/XML/FileReader.cpp:467
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Not all the images in the database have information about image sizes; "
"this is needed to get the best result in the thumbnail view. To fix this, "
"simply go to the <b>Maintenance</b> menu, and first choose <b>Remove All "
"Thumbnails</b>, and after that choose <tt>Build Thumbnails</tt>.</p><p>Not "
"doing so will result in extra space around images in the thumbnail view - "
"that is all - so there is no urgency in doing it.</p>"
msgstr "<p>U bazi podataka nemaju sve slike podatke o svojim dimenzijama, koji su potrebni za najbolji prikaz minijatura. Da biste to ispravili, otvorite izbornik <b>Održavanje</b>, odaberite <b>Ukloni sve minijature</b>, a zatim <tt>Izradi minijature</tt>.</p><p>Ako to ne učinite, oko slika će se u prikazu minijatura pojaviti dodatni prostor – i to je sve, pa nije hitno.</p>"

#: DB/XML/FileReader.cpp:472
#, kde-format
msgid "Not All Images Have Size Information"
msgstr "Neke slike nemaju podatke o veličini"

