#: Settings/ThumbnailsPage.cpp:98
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>If you select <b>Settings -&gt; Show Tooltips</b> in the thumbnail view, "
"then you will see a small tool tip window displaying information about the "
"thumbnails. This window includes a small preview image. This option "
"configures the image size.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Ako u prikazu minijatura odaberete <b>Postavke -&gt; Prikaži opise</b>, prikazat će se mali prozor s informacijama o minijaturama. U njemu se nalazi i mala pregledna slika. Ovom mogućnošću podešava se njezina veličina.</p>"

#: Settings/ThumbnailsPage.cpp:104
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Thumbnail image size. Changing the thumbnail size here triggers a rebuild "
"of the thumbnail database.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Veličina minijatura. Promjenom veličine ovdje ponovno će se izraditi baza minijatura.</p>"

#: Settings/ThumbnailsPage.cpp:108
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>If this is set, thumbnails are built on demand. As you browse your image "
"database, only those thumbnails that are needed are actually built. This "
"means that when you change the thumbnail size, KPhotoAlbum will remain "
"responsive even if you have lots of images.</p><p>If this is not set, "
"KPhotoAlbum will always build the thumbnails for all images as soon as "
"possible. This means that when new images are found, KPhotoAlbum will "
"immediately build thumbnails for them and you won't have a delay later while "
"browsing.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Ako je ova mogućnost uključena, minijature se izrađuju prema potrebi. Tijekom pregledavanja baze slika izrađuju se samo potrebne minijature. Tako će KPhotoAlbum ostati odzivan pri promjeni veličine minijatura, čak i ako imate mnogo slika.</p><p>Ako mogućnost nije uključena, KPhotoAlbum će što prije izraditi minijature za sve slike. Kada pronađe nove slike, odmah će izraditi njihove minijature pa tijekom kasnijeg pregledavanja neće biti odgode.</p>"

#: Settings/ThumbnailsPage.cpp:117
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Choose what aspect ratio the cells holding thumbnails should have.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Odaberite omjer stranica ćelija s minijaturama.</p>"

#: Settings/ThumbnailsPage.cpp:120
#, kde-format
msgid "<p>How thick the cell padding should be.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Odredite veličinu unutarnjeg razmaka ćelija.</p>"

#: Settings/ThumbnailsPage.cpp:123
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>If you want to see grid around your thumbnail images, select this option."
"</p>"
msgstr "<p>Odaberite ovu mogućnost ako želite prikazati mrežu oko minijatura.</p>"

#: Settings/ThumbnailsPage.cpp:127
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Checking this option will show the base name for the file under "
"thumbnails in the thumbnail view.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Označite ovu mogućnost da biste ispod minijatura prikazali naziv datoteke bez nastavka.</p>"

#: Settings/ThumbnailsPage.cpp:131
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Checking this option will show the Categories for the file under "
"thumbnails in the thumbnail view</p>"
msgstr "<p>Označite ovu mogućnost da biste ispod minijatura prikazali kategorije datoteke.</p>"

#: Settings/ThumbnailsPage.cpp:135
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>When you are browsing, and the count gets below the value specified here, "
"the thumbnails will be shown automatically. The alternative is to continue "
"showing the browser until you press <i>Show Images</i></p>"
msgstr "<p>Tijekom pregledavanja minijature će se automatski prikazati kada broj stavki padne ispod ovdje navedene vrijednosti. U suprotnom će preglednik ostati prikazan dok ne pritisnete <i>Prikaži slike</i>.</p>"

#: Settings/UntaggedGroupBox.cpp:24
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If a tag is selected here, it will be added to new (untagged) images "
"automatically, so that they can be easily found. It will be removed as soon "
"as the image has been annotated."
msgstr "Ako ovdje odaberete oznaku, automatski će se dodavati novim slikama bez oznaka kako biste ih lakše pronašli. Uklonit će se čim dodate napomene slici."

#: Settings/UntaggedGroupBox.cpp:45
#, kde-format
msgid "Show the untagged images tag as a normal tag"
msgstr "Prikaži oznaku za slike bez oznaka kao običnu oznaku"

#: Settings/UntaggedGroupBox.cpp:54
#, kde-format
msgid "None Selected"
msgstr "Ništa nije odabrano"

#: Settings/UntaggedGroupBox.cpp:117
#, kde-format
msgid "New tag added"
msgstr "Dodana je nova oznaka"

#: Settings/UntaggedGroupBox.cpp:118
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>The new tag \"%1\" has been added to the category \"%2\" and will be used "
"for untagged images now.</p><p>Please save now, so that this tag will be "
"stored in the database. Otherwise, it will be lost, and you will get an "
"error about this tag being not present on the next start.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Nova oznaka „%1” dodana je u kategoriju „%2” i sada će se koristiti za slike bez oznaka.</p><p>Spremite promjene kako bi se oznaka pohranila u bazu podataka. U suprotnom će biti izgubljena i pri sljedećem pokretanju dobit ćete pogrešku jer oznaka ne postoji.</p>"

#: Settings/VideoPlayerSelectorDialog.cpp:30
#, kde-format
msgid "<h1>Choose a Video Player</h1>"
msgstr "<h1>Odaberite videoreproduktor</h1>"

#: Settings/VideoPlayerSelectorDialog.cpp:33
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><p>Unfortunately, there is no video player which just works out of the "
"box for everyone.</p><p>KPhotoAlbum therefore comes with three different "
"back-ends, choose the one that works the best for you</p><p><b>VLC</b> seems "
"to be the best supported video player back-end, meaning it can play most "
"video formats. It has one drawback though, it requires X11. If you use "
"Wayland, then you will find that the videos shows up in a window of their "
"own, and in this case VLC is likely not a very good fit for you. If on the "
"other hand you do use X11 then VLC is likely your best choice.</"
"p><p>Traditionally KPhotoAlbum has been using <b>Phonon</b> as the video "
"player back-end. We've unfortunately seen it crash on many different video "
"formats - possibly because our system wasn't correctly configured.</"
"p><p><b>QtMultimedia</b> is the newest video player back-end of the three. "
"It is a standard component of Qt. Expect it to become the new default, and "
"maybe only back-end.</p><p><b><font color=red>You can at any time change the "
"backend from Settings -> Viewer</font></b></p></html>"
msgstr "<html><p>Nažalost, ne postoji videoreproduktor koji svima radi odmah nakon instalacije.</p><p>Zato KPhotoAlbum nudi tri različita pozadinska sustava; odaberite onaj koji vam najbolje odgovara.</p><p>Čini se da je <b>VLC</b> najbolje podržan videoreproduktor i može reproducirati većinu formata. No ima nedostatak: zahtijeva X11. Ako koristite Wayland, videozapisi će se prikazivati u zasebnom prozoru pa VLC možda nije najbolji izbor. Ako koristite X11, VLC je vjerojatno najbolji izbor.</p><p>KPhotoAlbum je tradicionalno koristio <b>Phonon</b> kao pozadinski sustav za reprodukciju videozapisa. Nažalost, rušio se pri reprodukciji mnogih formata, možda zbog neispravne konfiguracije sustava.</p><p><b>QtMultimedia</b> najnoviji je od ova tri pozadinska sustava. Standardna je komponenta Qt-a. Očekuje se da će postati zadani, a možda i jedini pozadinski sustav.</p><p><b><font color=red>Pozadinski sustav možete u bilo kojem trenutku promijeniti pod Postavke → Preglednik.</font></b></p></html>"

#: Settings/VideoPlayerSelectorDialog.cpp:59
#: Settings/VideoPlayerSelectorDialog.cpp:68
#, kde-format
msgid " (NOT AVAILABLE)"
msgstr " (NIJE DOSTUPNO)"

#: Settings/VideoPlayerSelectorDialog.cpp:97
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><h1>Missing back-end</h1>The back-ends which are not available are due "
"to the system configuration at compile time of KPhotoAlbum. If you compiled "
"KPhotoAlbum yourself, then search for the developer packages of the back-"
"ends. If you on the other hand got KPhotoAlbum from your system, then please "
"talk to the maintainer of the package.</html>"
msgstr "<html><h1>Nedostaje pozadinski sustav</h1>Pozadinski sustavi koji nisu dostupni ovise o konfiguraciji sustava u vrijeme kompiliranja KPhotoAlbuma. Ako ste sami kompilirali KPhotoAlbum, potražite razvojne pakete tih sustava. Ako ste KPhotoAlbum dobili uz distribuciju, obratite se održavatelju paketa.</html>"

